            <ArticleTitle>Paediatrics: messages from Munich.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">00016-2015</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The aim of this article is to describe paediatric highlights from the 2014 European Respiratory Society (ERS) International Congress in Munich, Germany. Abstracts from the seven groups of the ERS Paediatric Assembly (Respiratory Physiology and Sleep, Asthma and Allergy, Cystic Fibrosis, Respiratory Infection and Immunology, Neonatology and Paediatric Intensive Care, Respiratory Epidemiology, and Bronchology) are presented in the context of the current literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
